[1mCache drops entries early[m #42                               
open · alice opened 3 days ago                              
                                                            
  ## Summary                                                
                                                            
  The cache drops entries **too early** when the TTL is     
  short.                                                    
                                                            
  • Reproduce with --ttl 1s                                 
  • Watch the hit rate fall                                 
                                                            
    c := cache.New(cache.WithTTL(time.Second))              
                                                            
  @user0                                                    
    Comment 0 says hello.                                   
                                                            
  @user1                                                    
    Comment 1 says hello. Comment 1 says hello.             
                                                            
  @user2                                                    
    Comment 2 says hello. Comment 2 says hello. Comment 2   
    says hello.                                             
                                                            
                                                            
                                                            
                                                            
                                                            
                                                            
                                                            
                                                            